    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">For marine or inland transport, the Institute of Bankers &amp; Assurers (IBA) consignment bilty is mandatory. It serves as a receipt and a guarantee that the carrier will deliver the bike to the specified destination.</p>
