<p>While the above documents are compulsory, the most critical safeguard for your bike is the 100% declared‑value marine transit insurance. This type of coverage ensures that the full market value of the bike is protected against loss, damage, theft, or any other incident that may occur during transit.</p>
<p>By declaring the bike’s value and securing 100% coverage, you eliminate the risk of under‑insurance and guarantee that the insurer will reimburse the complete value if something goes wrong.</p>

<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">In summary, before shipping your bike from Tumsar, compile a self‑attested RC photocopy, a current PUC certificate, a valid insurance certificate, and an IBA‑approved consignment bilty.</p>
