      <span style="background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.12); color: #f59e0b; border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.35); padding: 4px 14px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 14px;">HANDOVER INSPECTION</span>
      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Destination Handover, Odometer Sign-Off &amp; Joint Condition Inspection for Bike Transportation In Tumsar</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>The destination delivery handover for two‑wheelers and motorcycles is a meticulous process designed to protect both the carrier and the customer. It begins immediately upon arrival at the destination port or hub, where the vehicle is subjected to a daylight condition re‑inspection.</p>
<p>This visual check is performed against the original pickup photos taken at the point of origin, ensuring that any damage incurred during transit is documented and that the bike’s condition matches the agreed standard. The inspector records any discrepancies in a dedicated log and, if necessary, photographs the issue for evidence.</p>

<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #f59e0b22; color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">01</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Daylight Condition Re‑Inspection:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Conduct a side‑by‑side comparison of the vehicle’s exterior and interior against the pickup photo set, noting dents, scratches, or fluid leaks. Use a calibrated light source to reveal surface imperfections that may not be visible in low‑light conditions.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Odometer Verification:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Cross‑check the mileage displayed on the motorcycle’s odometer with the odometer reading recorded on the LR bilty. Any variance beyond the acceptable tolerance (typically ±10 miles) triggers a secondary audit, and the discrepancy must be reported to the fleet manager.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">03</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Signed Condition Sign‑Off:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Once the visual inspection and odometer check are complete, the customer or authorized representative signs the delivery receipt. This signature confirms that the vehicle’s condition is acceptable and that the odometer reading matches the bilty.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-top: 10px;">
  <li style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.84rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 6px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px;">
    <i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; font-size: 0.8rem; margin-top: 3px; flex-shrink: 0;"></i>
    <span>The signed receipt is then scanned and stored in the digital asset management system for audit purposes</span>
  </li>
</ul>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #a855f722; color: #a855f7; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">04</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Photographic Documentation:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Capture a set of high‑resolution images of the bike from multiple angles post‑inspection. These images are appended to the delivery file and serve as a reference for any future claims or disputes.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #ec489922; color: #ec4899; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">05</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Final Audit and Closure:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The delivery manager reviews all inspection notes, odometer records, and signed receipts. Upon approval, the delivery file is closed in the logistics platform, triggering the release of payment to the carrier and updating the vehicle’s status in the fleet management system.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<p>This structured handover protocol ensures transparency, mitigates liability, and upholds the company’s reputation for delivering two‑wheelers and motorcycles in pristine condition.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>



